          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baava ku lusozi lwa Musengwa Katonda, baatambula olugendo lwa nnaku isatu. Era Esanduuku ey'Endagaano ya Musengwa Katonda yaabeesookangayo emberi olugendo lwa nnaku isatu, okubanooneza ekifo eky'okusimbamu weema dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lwe baatooleranga okutambula nga bava mu kifo ghe baabanga basimbye weema dhaibwe, ng'ekire kya Musengwa Katonda kiba ghaigulu ghaibwe omusana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
